{"data":{"content":"\"\"\"Lab 0: Getting Started.\"\"\"\n\n\ndef twenty_twenty_six():\n    \"\"\"Come up with the most creative expression that evaluates to 2026\n    using only numbers and the +, *, and - operators (or ** and % if you'd like).\n\n    >>> twenty_twenty_six()\n    2026\n    \"\"\"\n    return ______\n","line_count":12,"path":"lab00.py","sha256":"82335c78fdc41b72cd75854bed2d2c73647bf57f119f2b813ac37007375bd49b"},"hash":"101816c54bf8174858f986f7a1b602d54e252e08f60870b5d6e571363807c6c8","kind":"doc.open","prev_hash":"13055cd32049a82e2b053ec063b7d55559f0b468e819a33ea091a8122129e2ac","seq":25,"t":294279,"wall":"2026-11-01T08:53:52.615Z"}
